From 2e6ac9c4a18cbef523ccd3eab17cb1a41db95c4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:18:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 359/371] pirates: cannon defense from the end of the Port
 Royal docks (a gold pile takes a pirate and friends to a private cannon
 island with 4 cannons; 6 waves of raider ships come for the gold; sink them
 to keep it, everyone who took part is paid gold, max about 660), ported from
 the original game: AI + client + DC classes 255/256 at the end of pirates.dc
 (client patch 56 = v499 published first, then a full restart; rollback =
 want-cannon-defense 0 + AI restart)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 astron/dclass/pirates.dc                      |  12 +
 .../worldData/PortRoyalCannonIsland.py        |   3 +
 .../worldData/PortRoyalCannonWorld.py         |   3 +
 .../leveleditor/worldData/PortRoyalIsland.py  |  11 +
