 pirates/minigame/DistributedDefendWorldAI.py  | 586 ++++++++++++++++++
 pirates/world/GameAreaBuilderAI.py            |  17 +
 pirates/world/WorldCreatorAI.py               |   3 +
 11 files changed, 1146 insertions(+)
